Account Deletion Instructions

This page applies to the app: qianuxn

How to delete your account:

Open the app and go to "Me" in the bottom navigation bar.

Tap "Delete Account".

Your account and all associated data will be permanently deleted immediately.

Data that will be deleted:

Your account information and all personal profile data

All chat history and friend connections

All content you have created or uploaded

Data that may be retained:

Certain data required to be retained by applicable laws (such as security logs) will be kept for the legally required period and then automatically deleted.

For any questions, please contact us at: [your email address]

